<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1954381698"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1625994774"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Before I Rise"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="麻枝准 / やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Before I Rise"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:15.999"><div begin="00:26.664" end="05:15.999"><p begin="00:26.664" end="00:30.525" itunes:key="L1">その首に口付け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要亲吻那脖颈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ku bi ni ku chi du ke</span></p><p begin="00:30.526" end="00:33.575" itunes:key="L2">匂いを嗅いでたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">细嗅其中气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i wo ka i de ta i</span></p><p begin="00:33.576" end="00:40.419" itunes:key="L3">あるいはここで死のうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是在此死去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru i ha ko ko de shi no u ka</span></p><p begin="00:40.420" end="00:44.270" itunes:key="L4">ある晴れた放課後<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">某个天晴的下课后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ha re ta ho u ka go</span></p><p begin="00:44.271" end="00:47.923" itunes:key="L5">銃弾が降り注ぎ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">枪林弹雨侵袭而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ju u da n ga fu ri so so gi</span></p><p begin="00:47.924" end="00:52.392" itunes:key="L6">惨劇の季節が来た<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲惨的季节已然到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ge ki no ki se tsu ga ki ta</span></p><p begin="00:53.673" end="00:56.963" itunes:key="L7">風が止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清风停歇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:56.964" end="01:00.317" itunes:key="L8">風車も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风车不再旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu u sha mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:00.318" end="01:03.968" itunes:key="L9">ふいごも止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风箱也不再鼓动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i go mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:03.969" end="01:06.147" itunes:key="L10">音も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音断绝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:06.148" end="01:09.323" itunes:key="L11">息も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气息不再</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:09.324" end="01:12.731" itunes:key="L12">心臓も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心脏也停止了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n zo u mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:12.732" end="01:19.846" itunes:key="L13">そうしてすべてお仕舞いに出来たら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u shi te</span></p><p begin="01:20.283" end="01:23.689" itunes:key="L14">どうかそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="01:23.690" end="01:33.155" itunes:key="L15">こんな悪夢も狂おしいほど愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管是这样的噩梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na a ku mu mo</span></p><p begin="01:33.156" end="01:36.593" itunes:key="L16">出来れば笑って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以的话 请笑一笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki re ba wa ra 't te</span></p><p begin="01:36.594" end="01:40.036" itunes:key="L17">幾億光年<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿能历经几亿光年后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku o ku ko u ne n</span></p><p begin="01:40.037" end="01:45.566" itunes:key="L18">いつまでもいられますよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧常存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ma de mo i ra re ma su yo u</span></p><p begin="01:45.567" end="01:49.015" itunes:key="L19">お願いしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我由衷祈愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:58.023" end="02:01.802" itunes:key="L20">すべてを放り出し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放手一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te wo ho u ri da shi</span></p><p begin="02:01.803" end="02:05.464" itunes:key="L21">子供のようにはしゃぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像孩子一般嬉闹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo no yo u ni ha sha gu</span></p><p begin="02:05.465" end="02:11.726" itunes:key="L22">それは許されるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这能被允许吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ha yu ru sa re ru ka na</span></p><p begin="02:11.727" end="02:15.562" itunes:key="L23">そうだ明日は海へ行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是啊 明天去海边走走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u da a su ha u mi he i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:15.563" end="02:19.210" itunes:key="L24">おもちゃもたくさん持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上许多玩具</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo cha wo ta ku sa n mo 't te</span></p><p begin="02:19.211" end="02:23.664" itunes:key="L25">きみも一緒にどうかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也一起来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi mo i 's sho ni do u ka na</span></p><p begin="02:25.012" end="02:28.366" itunes:key="L26">風が吹いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清风开始吹拂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga fu i ta</span></p><p begin="02:28.367" end="02:31.581" itunes:key="L27">風車が回った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风车缓缓转动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu u sha ga ma wa 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:31.582" end="02:35.214" itunes:key="L28">ふいごが噴いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风向再次鼓动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i go ga fu i te</span></p><p begin="02:35.215" end="02:37.566" itunes:key="L29">爆音がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发出一阵爆音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ku o n ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:37.567" end="02:40.610" itunes:key="L30">酸素を吸った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼吸空气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n so wo su 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:40.611" end="02:44.021" itunes:key="L31">鼓動が響いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳不断鸣响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do u ga hi bi i ta</span></p><p begin="02:44.022" end="02:51.175" itunes:key="L32">そうして何もかも動き始める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而后 所有的一切开始转动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so shi te na ni mo ka mo u go ki ha ji me ru</span></p><p begin="02:51.573" end="02:54.995" itunes:key="L33">長い夢だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不过是一场漫长梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga i yu me da 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:54.996" end="02:58.426" itunes:key="L34">早く目覚めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点醒来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ya ku me za me te</span></p><p begin="02:58.427" end="03:02.194" itunes:key="L35">笑い飛ばしたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想对一切一笑而过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i to ba shi ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:02.195" end="03:07.794" itunes:key="L36">さあ早くキスして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快来亲吻我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a ha ya ku ki su shi te</span></p><p begin="03:07.795" end="03:11.244" itunes:key="L37">ここから起こして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唤醒我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra o ko shi te</span></p><p begin="03:11.245" end="03:16.787" itunes:key="L38">そんなおとぎ話にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把眼前化为美好的童话故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na o to gi ba na shi ni shi te</span></p><p begin="03:16.788" end="03:20.130" itunes:key="L39">ねえ王子様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 王子殿下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e o u ji sa ma</span></p><p begin="03:30.101" end="03:33.553" itunes:key="L40">心は孤独だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心 是孤独的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha ko do ku da</span></p><p begin="03:33.554" end="03:36.964" itunes:key="L41">愛は見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法看清爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha mi e na i</span></p><p begin="03:36.965" end="03:43.774" itunes:key="L42">数値に出来ない感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的感情无法化为数值</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su u chi ni de ki na i ka n jo u</span></p><p begin="03:43.775" end="03:47.232" itunes:key="L43">でも震えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但仍在颤抖着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo fu ru e te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:47.233" end="03:50.721" itunes:key="L44">脈を打ち続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拍打着心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mya ku wo u chi tsu du ke ru</span></p><p begin="03:50.722" end="03:59.613" itunes:key="L45">波に浮かぶ残骸のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就像浮在海面上的残骸一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi ni u ka bu za n ga i no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="04:00.085" end="04:03.563" itunes:key="L46">どうかそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你陪在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="04:03.564" end="04:06.921" itunes:key="L47">きみよそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">陪在我身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi yo so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="04:06.922" end="04:10.400" itunes:key="L48">夢だっていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管只是梦一场 也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me da 't te i i yo</span></p><p begin="04:10.401" end="04:16.397" itunes:key="L49">まだ目覚めてない振りして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍在佯装还未醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da me za me te na i fu ri shi te</span></p><p begin="04:16.398" end="04:19.856" itunes:key="L50">きみすら消えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连你都消失了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi su ra ki e te</span></p><p begin="04:19.857" end="04:23.333" itunes:key="L51">匂いも忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也遗忘了你的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i mo wa su re te</span></p><p begin="04:23.334" end="04:28.745" itunes:key="L52">世界に取り残さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神啊 请别让我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ni to ri no ko sa na i de</span></p><p begin="04:28.746" end="05:15.999" itunes:key="L53">どうか神様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被这世界抛弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka ka mi sa ma</span></p></div></body></tt>